# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Committed as documentation; .env*.local is gitignored.
#
# There is nothing required here for the forms.
#
# The Contact, Volunteer, Apply and Newsletter forms POST to
# https://formsubmit.co/ajax/info@faithfoundationsf.org — the destination
# mailbox is part of the URL, so there is no account, no API key and no
# environment variable to set (in Vercel or anywhere else).
#
# See src/lib/web3forms.ts for the one-time mailbox activation step.
